Package: ACWR
Type: Package
Title: Acute Chronic Workload Ratio Calculation
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jorge R",
             "Fernandez-Santos",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "jorgedelrosario.fernandez@uca.es",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5047-2976"))
Maintainer: Jorge R Fernandez-Santos <jorgedelrosario.fernandez@uca.es>
Description: Functions for calculating the acute chronic workload ratio using three
            different methods: exponentially weighted moving average (EWMA), rolling
            average coupled (RAC) and rolling averaged uncoupled (RAU). Sessions are
            placed on a daily calendar, so rest days count as zero load. Examples of
            these methods can be found in Williams et al. (2017) <doi:10.1136/bjsports-2016-096589>
            for EWMA and Windt & Gabbett (2019) <doi:10.1136/bjsports-2017-098925> for
            RAC and RAU.
